{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415739","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415739","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041573901:1":{"text":"어휴, 시끄러워 죽겠네.","source_cn":"哼，这地方吵死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9978D0AEA01190F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573902:1":{"text":"야, 쇠대가리! 뭘 봐?","source_cn":"你，铁块头，别傻愣愣地盯着我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x126FC22CBC3B01CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573903:1":{"text":"어디서 온 촌놈이냐? 위대한 쿠루루 님의 무적 폭탄 맛을 보고 싶은 것이냐!","source_cn":"哪来的土家伙，当心伟大的库露露大人无敌的炸弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF0C08FAB19DA35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573904:1":{"text":"화력! 강력!","source_cn":"火力，强劲！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99634BF12F519B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573905:1":{"text":"확! 이걸 그냥... 잠깐, 뭐? 뭐라고 했어?","source_cn":"……嗯？你刚刚说啥？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FAC75A05C677D8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573906:1":{"text":"쿠루루 님이 묻고 계시잖아! 똑바로 말해. 방금 그거 무슨 뜻이야?!","source_cn":"库露露大人问你话呢，说清楚，你刚才那话是什么意思？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76107C5C4EA48198","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573907:1":{"text":"네 폭탄! 대단하다!","source_cn":"厉害，你的炸弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB652E773BD96AA79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573908:1":{"text":"크흠, 쇠대가리 주제에 제법 보는 눈은 있군! 사실 이 탁자째로 저 멀리 날려버릴까 했는데 말이야.","source_cn":"咳咳，算你眼光不赖，本来想把这张桌子连着你一起炸飞的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EEB85B87D96C6C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573909:1":{"text":"뭘 좀 아는 녀석 같으니까, 특별히 봐줄게!","source_cn":"看在你挺懂行的份上，就算了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E202D2FF52ED31C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573910:1":{"text":"너무 고마워할 필요는 없어. 정 고마우면 네 진심을 조금 더 표현해 봐.","source_cn":"也不用太感谢我，再多说几句真话就行了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCAABDF91831062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573911:1":{"text":"멋지다. 쿠루스터 같다.","source_cn":"酷。像库露丝塔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBE75A9273E76CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573912:1":{"text":"가, 감히! 감히 고귀하신 쿠루루 님의 이름을 함부로 부르다니! 쿠루루 님이 가만 두지...","source_cn":"大胆！居然敢直呼高贵的库露露大人的名讳，库露露大人饶不了——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41794D3D2D1E72CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573913:1":{"text":"팡팡, 조용히 해봐! 쇠대가리, 너 쿠루스터를 알아?","source_cn":"哎哎，阿爆你先别说话！铁块头，你知道她？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5007D6907A8D7C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573914:1":{"text":"우상. 완벽하다.","source_cn":"偶像，完美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E2448802F016B02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573915:1":{"text":"드워프, 전부 날린다!","source_cn":"矮人，全部摧毁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E1CB2FC9E4FF208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041573916:1":{"text":"헤헤헤... 에이 뭘 우상까지야~ 됐어, 됐어. 다 옛날 일인걸.","source_cn":"哎呀，好了好了，都是过去的事了，谦虚点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0530A3BD50889AB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041573917:1":{"text":"너, 화력을 좀 아는 녀석이잖아? 자자, 원샷! 다 마시면 특별히 내가 만든 새로운 레시피를 보여줄게!","source_cn":"看你也是个懂火力的家伙，来，干了这杯，给你看看我的新配方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F1DF2656AF7A9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041573918:1":{"text":"기대! 세상을 뒤집을 폭발!","source_cn":"期待，炸翻天！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x203207D6F930BEB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041573919:1":{"text":"흠흠. 쿠루루 님에게 상을 받다니, 운 좋은 줄 알아!","source_cn":"哼哼，算你走运，感恩酷露露大人的赏赐吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BE456ACCDEC85F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库露露":{"text":"쿠루루","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿爆":{"text":"팡팡","source":"阿爆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勒图姆":{"text":"군나르","source":"勒图姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}